      "gate": "Defect reproduction",
      "outcome": "PASS",
      "reason": "Each fixed defect was reproduced on the base commit and each new or extended test fails there: land-records returned 400 instead of 401 for a non-ASCII Authorization header and served JSON error bodies with the asset's text/html or text/javascript type; the Earth Engine OAuth callback raised an uncaught TypeError for a non-ASCII state; the release store left every SQLite connection unclosed (4 ResourceWarnings on Python 3.13 for one initialize and three reads); malformed or null JSON to the historical-topo overlay/activate and daily-archive POST routes returned 503 storage errors instead of 400; lightning PNG and USGS topo catalog reads buffered a chunked body without Content-Length before checking the limit; API-connection reservation rows appeared as daily-archive catalog entries and widened its day span. requirements-tiles.txt had lost its pyproj and rasterio pins in merge 519a773f75, so the declared environment could not import prepare.py."
