  "notes": "Repository-wide debugging sweep fixes. Runtime behavior changes are limited to status codes and media types on error paths, closing SQLite connections, streamed byte limits on two upstream reads, and excluding API-connection rows from the daily-archive catalog listing (storage accounting still includes them). Also restores two dropped pins in an isolated pipeline requirements file and clears a stray executable bit on a validator without a shebang. No data, policy, schema, release or publication change. The Site edits are in the monorepo mirror under apps/site/source; the standalone Site source needs the same edits for deployment."
